cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Two-sided partial locality: exact certificates for a partial-locality facet and a sharp Schmidt-number-two Bell bound"
abstract: >-
  Exact certificates for a Bell functional F in the 3-setting, 2-outcome bipartite scenario.
  F <= 7 is a facet of the convex hull of the Alice-side and Bob-side partial-local sets, and
  of neither one-sided hull. An exact positive rational Gram certificate proves F <= 7 for
  every behavior of Schmidt number at most two, and an exactly specified qutrit realization
  violates it. Priority is unresolved and the results have not had human expert review.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jones
    given-names: Steven W.
repository-code: "https://github.com/stevenwarejones/two-sided-partial-locality"
license: MIT
